{"t":"Alwin","s":"alwin-7f1d9","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Alwin</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVenore\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145804&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32875,32125,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32875, 32125, 6)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Guard</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221211085734&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alwin_b48ec1.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Alwin.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Southwestern gate of <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>He protects the city of Venore from attacking creatures from the swamp. Alwin gives short, basic information about the town and surrounding swamps.<br/>\nAnd the most important thing! \"Do not try to say any dirty word to him! Or he attacks and burns you! (burns faster than normal fire)\".\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Alwin.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hello</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Alwin</strong>: LONG LIVE THE KING!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Job</b><br/>\nAlwin: I am a protector of the people of <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Venore</b><br/>\nAlwin: The harbour is to the north, the weapon market in the south, the general market to the west, and the bank to the east. You will find other shops and the Hard Rock Tavern in the center.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>King</b><br/>\nAlwin: Tibianus III is our beloved king!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Tibianus</b><br/>\nAlwin: Tibianus III is our beloved king!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll%20Cave\">Swamp</a></b><br/>\nAlwin: The swamp is a dangerous place and full of monsters, not to mention all those swampelves living at <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadowthorn\">shadowthorn</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Amazon\">amazons</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll\">swamptrolls</a>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Monsters</b><br/>\nAlwin: The swamp is full of nasty <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">snakes</a> and there's a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragon</a> breeding ground somewhere in the swamps.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Amazons</b><br/>\nAlwin: They are the best example for the results of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> madness.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Swamptroll</b><br/>\nAlwin: This hideous creatures are even more ugly than the normal <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">trolls</a>. They are treacherous and use several poisons.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Bye</b><br/>\nAlwin: LONG LIVE THE KING!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Alwin</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32875,"y":32125,"z":6}}